<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title><%= post ? '게시글 수정' : '글 쓰기' %> - 관리자</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Pretendard:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.2.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" />
    <link href="https://cdn.quilljs.com/1.3.7/quill.snow.css" rel="stylesheet" />
    <style>
      body { font-family: "Pretendard", sans-serif; background: #f8fafc; }
      .admin-main h1 { color: #1a237e; }
      .board-img-preview { width: 80px; height: 80px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #dee2e6; flex-shrink: 0; }
      .board-img-preview img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
      .quill-editor-wrap { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #dee2e6; border-radius: 0.375rem; overflow: hidden; }
      .quill-editor-wrap .ql-toolbar { border: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #dee2e6; font-family: "Pretendard", sans-serif; }
      .quill-editor-wrap .ql-container { border: none; font-family: "Pretendard", sans-serif; font-size: 15px; min-height: 220px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="admin-layout">
      <%- include("./adminNav.ejs") %>
      <main class="admin-main">
        <div class="container py-5">
          <h1 class="h4 mb-4" style="font-weight: 700;"><%= post ? '게시글 수정' : '글 쓰기' %></h1>
          <form id="adminBoardForm" action="<%= post ? '/admin/boardEdit' : '/admin/boardWrite' %>" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">
            <% if (post) { %><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<%= post._id %>" /><% } %>
            <div class="mb-3">
              <label class="form-label">카테고리</label>
              <select name="categoryId" class="form-select" style="max-width: 200px;">
                <option value="">선택 안 함</option>
                <% (categories || []).forEach(function(c){ %>
                <option value="<%= c._id %>" <%= post && post.categoryId && post.categoryId.toString() === c._id.toString() ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= c.name %><%= c.nameEn ? ' / ' + c.nameEn : '' %></option>
                <% }); %>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">제목 (한글)</label>
                <input type="text" name="title" class="form-control" value="<%= post ? (post.title || '') : '' %>" placeholder="한글 제목" />
              </div>
              <div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
                <label class="form-label">Title (English)</label>
                <input type="text" name="titleEn" class="form-control" value="<%= post ? (post.titleEn || '') : '' %>" placeholder="English title" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3">
              <label class="form-label">내용 (한글)</label>
              <p class="small text-muted mb-2">굵게·밑줄·링크(URL) 삽입 가능. 링크 아이콘으로 하이퍼링크를 넣으면 게시글에서 클릭됩니다.</p>
              <div class="quill-editor-wrap mb-1">
                <div id="editor-ko"></div>
              </div>
              <textarea name="content" id="field-content" class="d-none" aria-hidden="true"><%- post ? (post.content || '') : '' %></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-3">
              <label class="form-label">Content (English)</label>
              <div class="quill-editor-wrap mb-1">
                <div id="editor-en"></div>
              </div>
              <textarea name="contentEn" id="field-content-en" class="d-none" aria-hidden="true"><%- post ? (post.contentEn || '') : '' %></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="mb-4">
              <label class="form-label">이미지 (여러 장 선택 가능)</label>
              <% if (post && post.images && post.images.length) { %>
              <div class="current-images mb-3">
                <div class="small text-muted mb-2">현재 등록된 이미지 (<%= post.images.length %>장). 수정 시 파일을 선택하지 않으면 그대로 유지됩니다. 새로 선택하면 기존 이미지 뒤에 추가됩니다.</div>
                <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                  <% post.images.forEach(function(src){ %>
                  <div class="board-img-preview">
                    <img src="<%= src %>" alt="" />
                  </div>
                  <% }); %>
                </div>
              </div>
              <% } %>
              <input type="file" name="images" class="form-control" accept="image/*" multiple />
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex gap-2">
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="background: #007BFF; border: none;">저장</button>
              <a href="/admin/boardList" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">목록</a>
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
        <script src="https://cdn.quilljs.com/1.3.7/quill.js"></script>
        <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.2.2/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
        <script>
          (function () {
            var toolbar = [["bold", "italic", "underline"], ["link"], ["clean"]];
            var quillKo = new Quill("#editor-ko", {
              theme: "snow",
              modules: { toolbar: toolbar },
              placeholder: "글 내용",
            });
            var quillEn = new Quill("#editor-en", {
              theme: "snow",
              modules: { toolbar: toolbar },
              placeholder: "Content in English",
            });

            function loadIntoQuill(quill, raw) {
              if (!raw || !String(raw).trim()) return;
              var s = String(raw);
              if (/<[a-z][\s>/]/i.test(s.trim())) {
                quill.clipboard.dangerouslyPasteHTML(s);
              } else {
                quill.setText(s);
              }
            }

            loadIntoQuill(quillKo, document.getElementById("field-content").value);
            loadIntoQuill(quillEn, document.getElementById("field-content-en").value);

            document.getElementById("adminBoardForm").addEventListener("submit", function () {
              document.getElementById("field-content").value = quillKo.root.innerHTML;
              document.getElementById("field-content-en").value = quillEn.root.innerHTML;
            });
          })();
        </script>
      </main>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
